zed content. FAQ sections, comparison tables, and self-contained paragraphs are more likely to be extracted and cited than walls of text.","@type":"Answer"}},{"name":"Can Zunkiree Labs run AEO/SEO work regardless of where my team is located?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"text":"Yes. We run AEO and SEO programs for clients globally, including the US, UK, India, Australia, Canada, Switzerland, and the Netherlands, tailoring keyword and structured-data strategy to each market's own search and AI-answer behavior.","@type":"Answer"}}]}</script><!-- SEOAI:QACONTENT:END -->
